"""Random Forest Transition Model for Colombia Dataset (5-Year Lookahead Prediction)
Train RandomForestClassifier on pre-split parquet files: train_colombia_win5 (2000-2014), 
earlystop_colombia_win5 (2015-2017), test_colombia_win5 (2018-2019). Final model trained on 2000-2017,
evaluated on 2018-2019.
Target: transition_01_win5 (1 if transition occurs within next 5 years, else 0)

Features:
- Right-Censoring Protection: Earlystop and test data filtered to LAST_LABEL_YEAR
  (LAST_LABEL_YEAR = WDPA_LAST_YEAR - LOOKAHEAD_YEARS) to avoid evaluating on
  labels that don't have complete 5-year lookahead information
- Imbalance Handling: Uses class_weight="balanced_subsample" by default
"""

